@baseUrl = http://localhost:8096

### Create game

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tictactoe
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "players": [
    "8e5823e3-1b6d-4c90-96ef-2fbdb0e43bc0"
  ],
  "difficulty": "hard"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("gameId", response.body['id']);
%}

### Make a move

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tictactoe/{{gameId}}/move
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "playerId": "8e5823e3-1b6d-4c90-96ef-2fbdb0e43bc0",
  "row": 1,
  "col": 1
}

### Test ai response
POST http://localhost:8000/games/tic-tac-toe/best-move
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "game_name": "tic_tac_toe",
  "difficulty": "hard",
  "current_player": "O",
  "board": [
    [
      null,
      null,
      null
    ],
    [
      null,
      "X",
      null
    ],
    [
      null,
